1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,492
Inside every analogue meter is a moving coil galvanometer.

2
00:00:04,492 --> 00:00:12,226
It has a resistance G, and gives a full scale deflection for a small current, I g, a few milliamperes.

3
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:17,148
Only the resistor bolted onto it decides what kind of meter it becomes.

